        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Blur an Image\n\nSoftens an image with a gaussian blur. Use it for backplates behind text or to obscure a background before publishing. It runs locally with no model, key or cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Image\" takes the picture. \"2 Blur\" applies a gaussian blur of size 12. \"3 Result\" shows the softened image.\n\n**Try this:** Raise size on \"2 Blur\" to 30 for a heavy background blur, or lower it to 4 for a light softening."
        },
